  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>EEE</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>RR</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>AA</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>NN</mi></math><br /><br /><math><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder></math><br /><br />Two empty places can filled with identical letters <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>EE</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>AA</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NN</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> ways<br /><br />Two empty places, can be filled with distinct letters <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Number of words <math><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>59</mn></math>"
